{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear players, we are very sorry. If you encounter language display problems, please select your language here\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/4ee223c1a7a5d3ae0f6ea8d370a5ddcd.avif?t=1750126452\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras_big/4ee223c1a7a5d3ae0f6ea8d370a5ddcd.avif?t=1750126452 width=800 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/dbbc168b8780d1e9e2a12f534e26e504.avif?t=1750126452\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras_big/dbbc168b8780d1e9e2a12f534e26e504.avif?t=1750126452 width=800 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game update preview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More skill combination options, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more equipment options, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more exciting and tense challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/7ea4ca78fdd65d50b623575203590b0a.avif?t=1750126452\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras_big/7ea4ca78fdd65d50b623575203590b0a.avif?t=1750126452 width=800 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Dungeon Legend Party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Discard : </strong>DungeonLegendParty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dance in the whirlpool of death, and write your survival epic with blood!</strong> <br><i>\u201cWhen the ancient dungeon opens thousands of crimson eyes, only the most cunning survivors will witness the next dawn\u2026\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Core Gameplay\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dungeon style roguelike adventure game. <br>\ud83d\udd25 Weave a web of survival with evasive maneuvers and ignite counter-storms with skills amidst 360-degree demonic onslaughts! Each 15-30-minute life-or-death roulette challenges your real-time decision-making and\u00a0Operation wow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>Star Burst Stream!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/29430c93a9e0c32e84c3630626f0d830.poster.avif?t=1750126452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/29430c93a9e0c32e84c3630626f0d830.webm?t=1750126452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/29430c93a9e0c32e84c3630626f0d830.mp4?t=1750126452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Shop System\u3011</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use currency to purchase <strong>skill tomes</strong> and learn otherworldly abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>healing items</strong> to save yourself from the brink of death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend <strong>hellish skeleton coins</strong> to challenge infernal bosses and claim <strong>epic gear</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Legendary Characters\u3011</strong> <br>\ud83c\udfad Choose your survival avatar:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Swordsman \u201cBlade Draw\u201d</strong> \u2013 Unleash wide-range sword slashes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primordial Man \u201cAwakening\u201d</strong> \u2013 Grow stronger in three attributes with each activation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AK47 Chicken \u201cCluckfire\u201d</strong> \u2013 Rain down rapid-fire bullet barrages <br>Each character boasts unique ultimate skills. Mix and match skills from shop tomes to craft your ultimate build!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/f854375407cf54d218885597ecc34844.poster.avif?t=1750126452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/f854375407cf54d218885597ecc34844.webm?t=1750126452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/f854375407cf54d218885597ecc34844.mp4?t=1750126452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Breath of Blood!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Game Art\u3011</strong> <br>Where flesh and machinery merge into cosmic horror! <br>Carve lethal geometries in space with bullet-hell patterns. <br>Every boss battle is a <strong>dynamic art exhibition</strong> \u2013 when the screen trembles under millions of damage numbers, you\u2019ll grasp the true meaning of <strong>violent aesthetics</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cRemember: In this subterranean labyrinth, survival isn\u2019t the goal\u2014conquering death in the most spectacular fashion is the only true legend!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(guitar hero!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i